<title>NEW ZEALAND: Apple &amp; Pear Board calls 3 p.m. news conference.</title>
<headline>Apple &amp; Pear Board calls 3 p.m. news conference.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Apple and Pear Marketing Board said it was holding a news conference at 3 p.m. on Tuesday on the export licence application by Apple Fields.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
